WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A recording seems to work. But what happens when a second group hears something different?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a twenty twenty-five clinical trial, participants receiving hypnosis reported a large decrease in hot-flash scores.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
So did people listening to white noise. The hypnosis group improved more on the main six-week outcome.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But that study did not test consumer focus recordings. An experience is not automatically evidence of the advertised cause.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before purchasing any soundtrack, ask which exact recording was tested,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
what outcome it measured, and what a credible comparison group experienced.
